WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:03.290
Queen's Blade.

00:00:03.290 --> 00:00:05.570
The defeated are left with disgrace and frustration,

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:08.440
while new trials await the victors.

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:12.870
Whether they advance or turn back, these warriors will face hell.

00:00:12.870 --> 00:00:15.280
These chains of heartless battles awaken the madness within them.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.520
Moment by moment, the terrain changes. There is nothing but sand in this place.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:35.110
Oh?

00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:38.930
Who was it that I have to remove from my path again?

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.410
You were thinking something like that, eh?

00:00:57.700 --> 00:00:59.270
But...

00:00:59.270 --> 00:01:02.750
You're forgetting something important.

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:05.600
Something you shouldn't forget.

00:01:05.600 --> 00:01:08.750
The sunlight that has shone upon the earth since ancient times...

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.490
is that of the great Kingdom of Amara!

00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:21.460
Come now! From this moment forward,
bow before the great Kingdom of Amara!

00:03:07.370 --> 00:03:09.910
Claudette is actually being overwhelmed.

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:22.480
Royal Headbutt!{yes it really is 王家の頭突き butting heads of royal family... http://gelbooru.com/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=31385}

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:23.490
Damn.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:34.360
Princess! Isn't she a fine woman, too?

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:36.690
She's about the best there is.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:39.280
You're right.

00:03:39.280 --> 00:03:44.430
I must certainly make this person my servant, as well.

00:03:45.810 --> 00:03:47.570
Thunder Shock!{雷鳴震撼 Thunder shake sounds gay.. so thunder shock it is ... http://gelbooru.com/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=118016}

00:03:53.780 --> 00:03:56.190
The sand is interfering with the electricity?

00:04:04.960 --> 00:04:07.570
Oh, I forgot to mention something!

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:13.730
If you're struck by the princess' curse, your strength will be completely drained.

00:04:13.730 --> 00:04:17.650
What has Menace been shouting about all this time?

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:22.030
"From this moment forward, bow before the great Kingdom of Amara!"

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:23.570
She's been saying things like that.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:27.490
The same as always{usual, the same, as ever}. That might be Menace's strength.

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:33.960
I admire her strength of will; the thousands of years she has dedicated towards fulfilling her wish.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:36.090
Onee-chan...

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:36.710
I need to pee.

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:40.850
You can't even go to the toilet by yourself?

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:41.840
But...

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.720
it's dark and it looks like a ghost might appear. I'm scared.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:50.600
You know, a spirit has been standing in front of you this whole time.

00:04:50.600 --> 00:04:51.850
You're a ghost!?

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.520
A spirit!

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:58.320
Shining Pyramid!{シャイニング・ピラミッド http://gelbooru.com/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=31433}

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:09.340
You should obediently serve the great Kingdom of Amara...

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:12.310
in all of its ancient glory.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.340
I know a person who is just like you.

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.210
Even his foolishness.

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.140
A man{person} clinging to his former glory.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:28.140
What did you say?

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.380
Curse Slap!{that sounds so gay.... binta is a slap in the face.... http://gelbooru.com/index.php?page=post&s=view&id=31425}

00:06:28.950 --> 00:06:30.820
A country should belong to its people.

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:36.720
Without even considering the lives of its citizens, how can you even talk of a flourishing country?

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:41.560
Sounds like a speech we've heard before.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:43.100
Was it...?

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:45.710
That foreign girl's story.

00:06:45.710 --> 00:06:50.910
Ah, those impertinent ones... Tomoe and Shizuka, right?

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.490
Just thinking about them makes me angry.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.270
Shizuka was quite a catch.

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.870
She had a strong spirit{mind, heart}.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:03.400
That's right.

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:04.910
Let's bring this to an end.

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:15.240
Your foolishness in blindly attempting
to protect your ancient authority is misguided!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:17.290
Let's go, princess!

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.220
This is the end.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.100
{}The sand is stuck is it the rain's fault?

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.910
Bow down before

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.100
Thunderclap,

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:39.610
the great Kingdom of Amara!

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:39.610
Strike!{those would be the real translation.. all sound bad: blow, hit, poke}

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:54.070
If you will not change, I will show you change!

00:07:54.950 --> 00:07:59.320
I'll become Queen for the sake of changing this country!

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.470
Yay!

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:03.630
It's onee-sama's victory!

00:08:08.800 --> 00:08:09.960
It's over.

00:08:12.160 --> 00:08:16.220
Haven't your tastes changed quite a bit since the last time we met?

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:19.850
I'll have you return my cute apprentice{disciple, pupil}.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:29.570
Risty...

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.420
you're despicable for becoming the Queen's dog.

00:08:32.420 --> 00:08:34.620
Wait! You're not getting away!

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:39.910
Setra...

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.780
For some reason, I'm a bit tired.

00:08:43.780 --> 00:08:50.050
It's fine, princess. I'm by your side, so you can sleep peacefully.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:53.380
After our rest, we can once again...

00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:57.750
Indeed, and then the Kingdom of Amara will...

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.980
This relic of the past is now worthy of its name.

00:09:02.980 --> 00:09:05.190
Just remain silent, as you should.

00:09:07.280 --> 00:09:08.110
Eh?

00:09:08.110 --> 00:09:09.740
What was I...

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:18.330
Menace...

00:09:21.400 --> 00:09:25.120
Come! Who were the latest victors to advance to the next round of Queen's Blade?

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:30.400
Some time ago, Lightning General Claudette achieved a magnificent victory!

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:31.460
Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe,

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.580
Veteran Mercenary, Echidna,

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:36.220
Kiba Assassin, Irma,

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:39.140
Temptress of the Underworld, Airi,

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:40.470
Imperial Commander, Elina,

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:42.950
Chivalrous Wasteland Thief, Risty,

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.430
and Vagrant Warrior, Leina.

00:09:45.430 --> 00:09:50.480
Oops. The Angel of Glory, Nanael, enters the finale by default.

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:53.900
She appeared! The big favorite makes her entrance!

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:59.590
It seems that Queen's Blade is getting more and more fierce!

00:09:59.590 --> 00:10:02.580
Which warrior is going to win next!?

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:06.000
Come now! Place your bets, place your bets!{well he just says, bet, bet! or wager! wager.. etc etc}

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.740
10 silver coins on Claudette!

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:11.120
30 silver coins on Echidna!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:13.960
Well then, one gold coin on Tomoe.

00:10:15.340 --> 00:10:21.120
Humans sure are cute for taking something like gambling so seriously.

00:10:21.120 --> 00:10:26.250
Oh!? Is no one going to bet on the Angel of Glory, Nanael?

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:30.120
She doesn't look very strong.

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:32.770
She doesn't seem too bright, either.

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:35.780
Why is an angel even participating in the first place?

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:40.320
Nanael-sama?

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:41.640
Yes?

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:43.200
What are you doing here?{in such a place, although she omits the doing.. in such a place, what?.. maybe why are you in such a place?}

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.490
Melpha!

00:10:45.550 --> 00:10:46.750
What is it that you want?

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.590
Give me your money! M-o-n-e-y! Hurry!

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:53.760
My dignity{prestige, good name} depends on it!

00:10:58.780 --> 00:11:00.220
How fortunate.

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.100
I guess so.

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:08.020
Oh!{uh-oh, oops etc sound strange here} 10 gold coins, 30 silver coins, and many copper coins!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:12.470
Suddenly, Nanael has risen to the most popular bet!

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:17.480
With this, you've preserved your dignity, correct?

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:19.170
I'm also very happy.

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:22.600
That's true, but... this is our dinner?

00:11:22.600 --> 00:11:26.800
Yes. Because you've spent everything that was left.

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:30.610
Don't tell me... we'll be eating this every day?

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.290
Please do not be concerned.

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.040
There is plenty in the garden, after all.

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:40.200
Say, onee-chan?

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:44.550
If my prediction is correct, I'll be fighting with you next.

00:11:44.550 --> 00:11:48.180
And when I win, we'll get closer and return home.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:52.080
Leaving aside the consequences, I will give it my all.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:53.840
That's no good!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:56.330
Elina, don't move.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.650
You're troubling{bothering} the painter.

00:11:57.650 --> 00:12:02.410
Eh? Just a little should be fine, right?

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:03.780
What are you doing!?

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.540
Don't move, onee-chan.

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.520
Geez, won't he have to repaint it now?

00:12:12.900 --> 00:12:14.010
Vulgar spirits!

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:18.970
Looks delicious.

00:12:19.580 --> 00:12:20.880
Evil spirits, disperse!{break up}

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:32.900
Hasn't anyone ever told you that interfering with a person's meal is bad manners?

00:12:35.290 --> 00:12:38.520
You can't do that, onee-chan! More people will...

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:41.820
You're Cattleya's...

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.050
You were sleeping well.{nicely}

00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:09.430
Echidna?

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:15.640
I doubt it's over yet, but you were still sleeping like a baby.

00:13:15.640 --> 00:13:16.400
Wh-

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:17.400
Shut up!

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:22.510
You're still like that, even after I carried you all the way to this room?

00:13:22.510 --> 00:13:24.030
I don't recall asking{requesting, relying on} you to do that.

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.610
Unfriendly{indifferent, cold, unkind, unsympathetic}, aren't we?

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:33.980
Speaking of which, you really have fallen, haven't you?

00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:34.960
What?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:41.380
With the Kiba assassins chasing after you, going after the Queen's head is impossible.

00:13:41.380 --> 00:13:42.590
Be silent.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:46.380
I have no reason to listen to you.

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:50.010
You aren't my master anymore.

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.160
Search the interior!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:57.200
We can't find them.

00:13:57.200 --> 00:13:58.850
They aren't here either.

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:03.600
Search the other areas.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.950
Risty-dono.

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:20.290
Her Highness requires your attendance at the castle.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.320
A new discovery.

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:53.030
So a spirit can raise a child, too.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:56.750
It isn't as if I'm raising him.

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.750
Are you feeling okay?

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:06.210
I will have you know that I'm quite well.

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:10.310
In any case, we'll be taking care of Rana-chan now.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.220
Wait, Tomoe-sama. We aren't in a position to...

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:20.700
We can't leave a human child in the care of a ghost.

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:22.400
But, you know...

00:15:23.110 --> 00:15:26.400
Well, that makes me happy. At last, I can have my fill.

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.750
From now on, I won't have to worry.

00:15:29.750 --> 00:15:32.470
Well then, everyone. Farewell!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.260
Wait, onee-chan!

00:15:40.270 --> 00:15:41.960
You can't go!{going is no good.. I really should just write it like that and don't edit it to give everyone a taste of japanese grammar... sucks ;)}

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.830
Tomoe-sama.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:50.980
That truly is a relief.

00:15:50.980 --> 00:15:55.720
As long as that child follows me around, I won't be able to get a good meal.

00:16:03.560 --> 00:16:04.980
Well then.

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:08.400
It's been a while since I've had some fresh life force.

00:16:12.680 --> 00:16:14.700
It's you again?

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:19.370
How many times must I tell you? There's no reason for me to be taking care of you...

00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:30.590
Well, dieting again for a little while isn't so bad either, I suppose.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:40.220
It's strange, isn't it?

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:43.480
When I see them in the dark, they look very much like ordinary siblings.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:47.940
Perhaps this means that people can change.

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.580
Well, she isn't a person, she's a ghost.

00:16:54.780 --> 00:16:55.940
Tomoe-sama.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.360
Elina, hasn't your pose changed?

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:10.170
It hasn't changed.

00:17:13.490 --> 00:17:16.820
Hey, where have you been touching me this whole time?

00:17:16.820 --> 00:17:17.650
Geez!

00:17:18.490 --> 00:17:20.250
<i>Hey- Elina!</i>

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.060
What is the matter?

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.860
The chosen one for this round of Queen's Blade shall be...

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.150
Imperial Commander, Elina.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:34.270
That's me, that's me!{well, me me! ;)}

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:43.950
I'm ready to go.

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:51.780
It's a bit sad that you aren't my opponent, Leina... but I'll see you later, okay?

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:02.790
Elina...

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:04.720
Do your best.

00:18:09.290 --> 00:18:11.020
It's a rather nice painting.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.670
Yeah, it really is.

00:18:20.470 --> 00:18:21.490
Leina.

00:18:22.210 --> 00:18:26.830
I'll show you that I can change our country... no, this continent.

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:28.750
Onee-sama.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.500
No matter what may happen, you must remember...

00:18:36.130 --> 00:18:40.590
The paths we walk are bound to be different.{our path we walk each to differ/vary to become}

00:18:40.590 --> 00:18:41.970
However, do not forget...

00:18:43.180 --> 00:18:45.140
We are sisters.

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:47.680
Always...

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.850
That will never change.

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.820
It's cold!{well just cold ;)}

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.550
Too cold! What's with this place!?

00:19:06.550 --> 00:19:08.440
I didn't hear about this!

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:10.330
I might freeze to death!

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:13.250
Stupid Queen!

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:16.150
I have been waiting for you.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.010
Warrior Shrine Maiden, Tomoe.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:26.190
You know, I...

00:19:26.190 --> 00:19:30.520
really hate country girls like you.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:53.830
It looks like we got away for now.

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:54.710
Yes.

00:19:55.410 --> 00:19:58.590
It's that one's fault. Just what were you thinking?

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:04.540
If we continue down this canal{waterway}, we'll make it out of Gainos.

00:20:04.540 --> 00:20:06.990
What did you say? I'm still not...

00:20:06.990 --> 00:20:08.130
Give it up.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.140
You won't defeat Aldra.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:15.030
I don't want you to die, Irma.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:17.940
Don't mess around with me!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.360
How dare you say something like that so calmly!?

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.660
You aren't my master anymore!

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.530
You...

00:20:25.530 --> 00:20:28.450
You abandoned me!

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:30.940
Don't come back after all this time.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.160
And start meddling in my affairs!

00:20:43.840 --> 00:20:48.510
The chosen one for this round of Queen's Blade shall be: Kiba Assassin, Irma.

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:51.180
You're going, no matter what?

00:20:52.200 --> 00:20:55.080
This is my reason for living.

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:56.930
I can't turn back now.

00:20:58.330 --> 00:20:59.180
Irma.

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:02.900
Don't die.

00:21:04.480 --> 00:21:06.950
Please take care of her until I return.

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:17.330
When I'm together with humans, I'm always the one left behind.

00:21:18.840 --> 00:21:22.550
I've lived a long time, so it can't be helped, but...

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.250
everyone disappears before me...

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:29.430
No matter how dear they are to me... everyone...

00:21:36.900 --> 00:21:38.790
I won't let you escape this time.

00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:43.280
Setora?

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:44.530
Setora?

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:48.530
Strange, he left me again and went off somewhere by himself.

00:21:48.530 --> 00:21:54.160
I'm always doing my best to revive my great kingdom!

00:21:54.160 --> 00:21:58.000
Come now, bow down before the great Kingdom of Amara!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.540
Swamp Witch.

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:02.170
An eerie existence.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.060
Well, we're all girls of the underworld.

00:22:04.060 --> 00:22:05.760
Majestic orders.

00:22:05.760 --> 00:22:07.590
Oh, Swamp Witch.

00:22:07.590 --> 00:22:08.930
Such erotic actions.

00:22:08.930 --> 00:22:10.600
We'll truly show our love for you.

00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:11.390
Yes.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:13.720
The three of us will all serve you.

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.470
Really?

00:22:14.470 --> 00:22:15.350
Most likely.

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.140
Girls, let's all do our jobs properly.

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:15.930
I am Melona!

00:23:15.930 --> 00:23:19.390
There were others aside from us
who were after the Queen's life, eh?

00:23:19.390 --> 00:23:21.770
Let's give our all to support Irma!

00:23:21.770 --> 00:23:24.340
The Queen's dog, Risty, looks pretty strong, though.

00:23:24.340 --> 00:23:26.400
With things like this, I don't care who.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:28.460
Won't someone just kill the Queen, already?

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:31.050
Well, I'm not really asking for help, or anything.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:32.550
Or maybe I am.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:37.100
Well, you know, I've had it with being a frozen newspaper!

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:40.060
Next time: Freezing! Unexpected Situation.

00:23:40.060 --> 00:23:43.400
Although we're apparitions, everything won't go our way!
